WEBVTT

00:04.850 --> 00:13.110
<b>A Playthrough of a Certain DUDE's
VRMMO LIFE</b>

01:30.480 --> 01:34.490
<b>Episode 10</b>

01:30.480 --> 01:34.490
<b>Earth Gets a Partner</b>

01:34.990 --> 01:36.960
We've finally made it to town.

01:36.960 --> 01:39.510
Sorry to make you run the whole night.

01:39.510 --> 01:41.020
I don't need an apology.

01:41.020 --> 01:42.730
For me, that's nothing!

01:42.730 --> 01:44.060
I see.

01:44.060 --> 01:46.150
I'm really grateful, though.

01:53.660 --> 01:56.260
Is there a new fad where 
everybody's playing instruments?

01:56.260 --> 02:00.590
Towns inside the Fairy Kingdom 
all love to promote the arts.

02:01.180 --> 02:03.660
To the north is Shepia, 
the town of literature.

02:03.660 --> 02:06.300
To the east is the town 
of painting, Sezanah.

02:06.300 --> 02:09.160
To the west is the town 
of sculpting, Ranjelo.

02:09.160 --> 02:12.970
And where we're at, in the south,
 is the town of music, Shubert.

02:14.270 --> 02:18.090
I bet I could hear all kinds of music 
just by walking through the streets.

02:20.260 --> 02:21.440
But I want to get some sleep.

02:21.440 --> 02:24.070
I've got an inn I always go to, then.

02:26.300 --> 02:28.780
With this many introduction letters,

02:28.780 --> 02:31.610
and having Wild-Haired Zetan bring you here,

02:31.610 --> 02:33.530
you're more than welcome to stay.

02:33.530 --> 02:35.090
Wild-Haired...?

02:35.090 --> 02:39.280
Innkeep, that nickname is 
embarrassing. Stop it.

02:40.420 --> 02:42.790
I've gotten you rooms next to each other.

02:42.790 --> 02:44.220
Enjoy your stay.

02:46.860 --> 02:49.490
See you later, Wild-Haired Zetan.

02:49.820 --> 02:51.190
Stop that!

02:54.450 --> 03:00.710
I was lucky that I got saved by a fairy 
famous enough to have his own nickname.

03:01.600 --> 03:04.670
<i>Now I can finally log out and sleep.</i>

03:08.910 --> 03:10.160
<b>You've logged in.</b>

03:10.170 --> 03:13.710
Now, time to do some adventuring!

03:14.580 --> 03:17.000
I-I can't move!

03:17.480 --> 03:19.550
Is this a bug?

03:29.100 --> 03:32.180
C-Can you get off me?

03:32.180 --> 03:35.130
If anybody sees this, 
they're gonna get the wrong idea!

03:35.130 --> 03:36.750
Big Brother's not gonna like me anymore!

03:36.750 --> 03:38.650
So I'm never gonna let him go!

03:40.310 --> 03:42.810
She's regressed to being an infant?

03:45.420 --> 03:49.930
Earth, since you're awake, 
how about some breakfast?

03:54.030 --> 03:55.880
I see I'm interrupting.

03:55.880 --> 03:57.710
I'll come back later.

03:59.170 --> 04:01.380
No! Save me!

04:01.780 --> 04:03.680
Save you from what?

04:04.340 --> 04:07.310
Oh, I see you brought a girl 
back to your room already.

04:07.310 --> 04:08.980
I did not bring her here!

04:08.980 --> 04:11.440
Help me get her off! Please!

04:11.440 --> 04:15.650
No! If I let go of Big Brother, 
he's gonna leave the kingdom!

04:16.490 --> 04:18.660
Y-Your Highness!

04:21.140 --> 04:25.580
Sister...

04:26.260 --> 04:28.300
You're kidding me. Now, of all times?

04:28.300 --> 04:30.510
A d-d-dragonian?!

04:32.880 --> 04:35.460
What are you doing?

04:35.460 --> 04:39.000
I came to apologize for what 
happened at the southern fort.

04:40.330 --> 04:43.390
I've punished the man who runs the fort,

04:43.390 --> 04:46.720
his daughter, as well as 
all 80 of her personal soldiers.

04:47.270 --> 04:49.530
Punished how, specifically?

04:49.530 --> 04:51.560
I summoned them to a special area,

04:51.560 --> 04:54.950
did near-lethal damage to them 
30 times and healed them 29 times,

04:54.950 --> 04:56.300
shattering their minds...

04:57.150 --> 05:00.110
Then, of course, I demoted the 
girl to the lowest rank of soldier,

05:00.110 --> 05:01.600
as well as the rest of them.

05:01.600 --> 05:03.950
The number of times she healed 
them and the number of times

05:03.950 --> 05:06.440
she did near-lethal damage 
don't match, do they?

05:06.440 --> 05:08.740
So the last time she did it, 
she just left them, huh?

05:08.740 --> 05:13.020
There it is. 
This is who my sister really is.

05:13.020 --> 05:14.040
She creeps me out.

05:14.040 --> 05:18.450
Well... the people in the 
town were all really nice.

05:18.450 --> 05:21.200
I don't hate your kingdom or anything.

05:21.200 --> 05:24.850
Really? You're not gonna start 
hating this country, Big Brother?!

05:27.850 --> 05:31.990
Stop trying to flirt with him, 
you stupid big sister!

05:31.990 --> 05:35.050
Ow! What was that for, 
you stupid little sister?

05:35.810 --> 05:39.650
If you're done talking, then you don't 
need to be here anymore, right?

05:39.650 --> 05:42.740
Ow! What about you? 
What are you doing here?

05:42.740 --> 05:44.400
I'm here to keep an eye on my stupid sister!

05:45.470 --> 05:46.660
Earth!

05:47.240 --> 05:50.660
I'm afraid I must be going.

05:51.230 --> 05:54.730
I apologize for causing a scene, Innkeep.

05:54.730 --> 05:55.610
Farewell.

05:58.280 --> 06:01.070
I knew you were close to the queen,

06:01.070 --> 06:04.580
but I didn't know you were 
friends with a dragonian, too.

06:04.580 --> 06:09.640
Were you aware that the fairies once 
started a war with the other nations?

06:11.010 --> 06:16.100
The dragonians were the ones we 
fought the deadliest battles with.

06:17.150 --> 06:21.810
If they knew a dragonian was in town, 
the whole city would be in an uproar!

06:21.810 --> 06:24.920
Seems we should all keep 
our mouths shut, then.

06:24.920 --> 06:27.140
I'll bring you a meal later.

06:27.400 --> 06:29.310
Enjoy your stay.

06:31.420 --> 06:34.080
What an awful way to wake up...

06:34.080 --> 06:37.790
Aw, you're lucky to have a pretty 
girl like her in love with you.

06:37.790 --> 06:39.850
I wish I had a girl like that.

06:41.750 --> 06:42.890
Come in.

06:43.480 --> 06:45.360
I apologize for the intrusion.

06:45.360 --> 06:49.410
I heard that Wild-Haired Zetan 
could be found here...

06:49.410 --> 06:51.180
Something I can do for you?

06:51.420 --> 06:54.290
My daughter's gone missing.

06:54.290 --> 06:56.340
I want you to find her for me!

06:57.490 --> 06:58.800
Calm down.

06:58.800 --> 07:01.010
Can you explain what happened?

07:02.470 --> 07:05.710
I'm sorry for being in such a panic.

07:05.710 --> 07:08.350
My name is Karen Fenrir.

07:08.350 --> 07:11.280
Fenrir... That's a famous noble family.

07:11.810 --> 07:16.640
My daughter always goes for a 
walk at the same time each day.

07:16.640 --> 07:19.800
But today, she didn't come back.

07:19.800 --> 07:23.410
I went to look for her,
 but I can't find her anywhere.

07:23.700 --> 07:27.970
You people can switch between human 
and wolf forms whenever you want.

07:27.970 --> 07:32.680
Even if a monster attacked her,
 they couldn't hurt her.

07:32.680 --> 07:37.640
And that's why I'm worried that 
something terrible may have happened.

07:38.260 --> 07:39.850
This is my daughter.

07:40.130 --> 07:43.600
I'll pay you, of course, so please...

07:44.450 --> 07:46.740
All right. I accept.

07:47.720 --> 07:49.400
Thank you!

07:49.400 --> 07:52.060
Zetan, I'll help, too.

07:52.550 --> 07:53.560
You're sure?

07:53.560 --> 07:55.550
Please do!

07:55.550 --> 07:59.570
I'll make sure you're properly 
rewarded for your trouble, as well!

08:01.740 --> 08:04.670
Sorry to make you help with 
a job that should be mine.

08:04.670 --> 08:09.170
I just wanted to repay you for 
carrying me all the way here, but...

08:09.170 --> 08:12.960
If I'm getting paid, too, 
then that doesn't really work.

08:12.960 --> 08:15.260
Well, aren't you nice?

08:15.260 --> 08:18.090
If you want to thank me, 
make me some more good food.

08:18.090 --> 08:19.840
Food's all you want?

08:19.840 --> 08:20.550
Yeah.

08:20.550 --> 08:22.390
Lookin' forward to it!

08:23.080 --> 08:26.830
This is farther than you'd go on a walk.

08:26.830 --> 08:31.330
The gate guard said he saw her, 
so this has to be the right direction.

08:32.400 --> 08:34.060
I sense monsters!

08:35.220 --> 08:38.630
Two from the right, one from the left!

08:47.640 --> 08:51.440
Your ability to detect monsters 
sure comes in handy.

08:51.440 --> 08:55.370
It definitely did on the way from the fort.

08:59.180 --> 09:02.850
With that kind of power, 
you could beat them easily anyway.

09:05.290 --> 09:07.000
So? What are we looking at?

09:07.000 --> 09:09.600
I'm not seeing anything but 
monsters for the moment.

09:10.030 --> 09:11.820
It will drain my resources faster,

09:11.820 --> 09:14.350
but I guess I'll try expanding the 
search radius to its maximum.

09:15.640 --> 09:18.160
I see a group of monsters, 
and something else!

09:18.160 --> 09:19.280
Okay, get on!

09:23.060 --> 09:25.780
<i>I saw two things that weren't monsters...</i>

09:28.630 --> 09:30.410
<i>Activate Long-Distance Vision!</i>

09:33.160 --> 09:36.230
That's definitely Miss Mina Fenrir.

09:36.230 --> 09:38.050
She's pretty badly hurt, too.

09:38.050 --> 09:39.170
What?

09:39.170 --> 09:41.680
We need to do something before night falls.

09:41.680 --> 09:44.140
Zetan, I want you to break past those goblins

09:44.490 --> 09:47.490
and splash Miss Mina with this rare potion.

09:48.080 --> 09:49.830
I'll back you up.

09:49.830 --> 09:50.510
Got it!

09:57.440 --> 09:58.360
Who's there?

10:08.530 --> 10:10.410
Excuse me, missy.

10:14.730 --> 10:16.350
My wounds healed...

10:16.350 --> 10:18.880
Can you hang in there a little longer now?

10:18.880 --> 10:20.020
Y-Yes!

10:20.020 --> 10:22.780
Okay, give 'em hell.

10:22.780 --> 10:26.090
And don't worry! 
I'll protect you if things get bad.

10:27.180 --> 10:28.010
Okay!

10:32.760 --> 10:34.310
That's the last of them.

10:34.920 --> 10:36.540
You're good.

10:36.540 --> 10:39.030
You know just how to help in a fight, 
and it made my life easier.

10:39.400 --> 10:43.410
I don't know who you are, 
but thank you for your support.

10:43.410 --> 10:48.670
Oh, no. We're only here because your 
mother hired us to help find you.

10:48.670 --> 10:50.100
My mother hired you?

10:50.100 --> 10:52.940
Yeah. I'm Zetan. And the human here is...

10:52.940 --> 10:54.320
I'm Earth.

10:54.920 --> 10:58.500
Zetan... You mean Wild-Haired Zetan?!

10:59.100 --> 11:02.050
Well, I guess some people call me that.

11:02.050 --> 11:06.770
I'm really lucky, aren't I? 
To have the famous Zetan save me!

11:06.770 --> 11:08.430
<i>Oh!</i>

11:10.360 --> 11:15.070
I'm sorry to ask this, Miss Mina, 
but why didn't you transform?

11:15.070 --> 11:18.530
Wouldn't have you been able to 
fight back more easily as a wolf?

11:19.060 --> 11:20.470
Well, you see...

11:20.470 --> 11:24.990
I was going for my walk when 
I smelled something slightly sweet...

11:24.990 --> 11:27.570
And suddenly everything went hazy.

11:27.570 --> 11:30.490
The next thing I knew, 
I was surrounded by goblins,

11:30.490 --> 11:32.580
and for some reason I couldn't transform...

11:32.580 --> 11:33.910
I see.

11:33.910 --> 11:37.080
Can you drink this and 
try transforming again?

11:48.030 --> 11:49.840
I was able to transform!

11:49.840 --> 11:51.890
Why couldn't I do it before?

11:51.890 --> 11:54.570
<i>The anti-poison potion worked.</i>

11:54.570 --> 11:56.810
<i>So I was right. Somebody poisoned her.</i>

11:57.440 --> 12:01.550
Okay, turn back to human form and 
have Zetan carry you back to town.

12:01.550 --> 12:03.540
What will you do?

12:03.540 --> 12:05.210
I'm a little tired.

12:05.210 --> 12:07.670
I'm going to rest here for 
a bit before I head back.

12:10.160 --> 12:11.640
Fine.

12:11.640 --> 12:13.360
Don't be too late.

12:16.760 --> 12:19.060
How long are you going to keep hiding?

12:20.310 --> 12:23.170
I sensed two things here 
that weren't monsters.

12:23.170 --> 12:27.980
And those goblins had some pretty 
expensive-looking equipment, didn't they?

12:28.540 --> 12:30.500
The ones with the shields were tankers.

12:30.500 --> 12:33.150
The ones with the spears pinned 
her down from a distance.

12:33.150 --> 12:35.520
And the ones with the swords 
attacked up close, right?

12:35.790 --> 12:37.930
The only race that could've 
made goblins fight as a team,

12:38.440 --> 12:41.850
and use poison to weaken a Fenrir...

12:47.570 --> 12:49.480
is a human!

12:49.830 --> 12:52.840
Wh-What the hell do you think you're doing?

12:52.840 --> 12:54.680
That's my line!

12:54.680 --> 12:57.620
Kidnapping and killing 
is what the bad guys do!

12:57.620 --> 13:01.890
I don't know if you did this on 
your own or if somebody hired you,

13:02.250 --> 13:04.790
but what's wrong with attacking a bad guy?

13:05.480 --> 13:06.930
Damn it...

13:08.020 --> 13:09.790
You...

13:10.720 --> 13:14.780
<i>This feeling... he's human, but not a PC.</i>

13:15.500 --> 13:20.140
<i>If I let him go, it might ruin relations 
between the humans and fairies,</i>

13:20.140 --> 13:24.200
<i>and even lead to a scenario 
where there's a war!</i>

13:24.510 --> 13:27.130
<i>Knowing the </i>One More<i> GMs, 
I could totally see that!</i>

13:27.450 --> 13:28.520
Damn you!

13:28.520 --> 13:30.460
I'll make sure you don't tell anyone!

13:32.220 --> 13:33.910
That's my afterimage!

13:35.270 --> 13:37.180
Triangle Shot!

13:40.180 --> 13:42.960
I changed course in mid-air, 
so it didn't hit as hard as it usually does...

13:42.960 --> 13:44.590
But it still did plenty of damage, I see.

13:44.590 --> 13:49.880
I'm human, you idiot! And they're fairies!

13:49.880 --> 13:54.810
Sorry. I don't care about what 
race or country somebody's from.

13:54.810 --> 13:57.300
All I care about is whether 
we can take each other's hand

13:57.300 --> 13:58.490
and walk beside each other.

14:06.510 --> 14:09.150
<i>If we can all admit our 
good parts, and bad parts,</i>

14:09.150 --> 14:12.180
<i>and walk beside each other, 
that's for the best...</i>

14:12.180 --> 14:15.210
<i>whether the other person 
is a fairy or dragonian.</i>

14:15.960 --> 14:20.170
<i>And if I have to fight, 
I'll show no mercy even to a human.</i>

14:26.840 --> 14:28.760
You didn't leave?

14:29.040 --> 14:31.420
I was curious if you caught your rat.

14:31.680 --> 14:32.660
Yup.

14:32.660 --> 14:34.590
I disinfected the place, too.

14:34.800 --> 14:35.990
Good, then.

14:35.990 --> 14:36.890
Get on.

14:36.890 --> 14:39.010
I'm fine. I'll walk.

14:39.010 --> 14:40.900
I want to give you a ride.

14:40.900 --> 14:43.440
Today, you're my partner.

14:43.440 --> 14:45.700
Earth, the human adventurer!

14:46.100 --> 14:49.090
All right. I'll take you up on that, then.

14:51.020 --> 14:53.500
Mina! You're safe!

14:53.500 --> 14:54.580
Mother!

14:54.840 --> 14:59.220
Zetan, Earth, thank you so much.

14:59.220 --> 15:02.950
I'll pay you 100,000 gloh each.

15:02.950 --> 15:07.090
There's one more reward 
I'd like to ask for, ma'am.

15:07.500 --> 15:09.390
Hey, that's plenty of money.

15:09.390 --> 15:11.520
I'd like you to ensure 
that Miss Mina and Zetan

15:11.520 --> 15:14.360
get a chance to spend some 
quality time together.

15:17.210 --> 15:23.200
As you can see, 
Miss Mina seems quite taken by him.

15:23.460 --> 15:29.250
I've heard so many tales of his bravery... 
and always wanted to meet him.

15:29.250 --> 15:32.910
And when I actually did, he was so kind...

15:32.910 --> 15:35.010
Oh, my! Oh, my!

15:35.010 --> 15:37.240
Earth, what do you think you're doing?

15:37.240 --> 15:39.420
Remember what you said this morning?

15:39.420 --> 15:42.700
You wanted a pretty girl 
who was in love with you.

15:42.700 --> 15:44.640
Miss Mina's certainly pretty, right?

15:44.920 --> 15:46.630
I look forward to spending time with you!

15:48.940 --> 15:52.430
I'll let the three of you 
work out the details!

15:52.430 --> 15:54.580
Have fun!

15:57.550 --> 15:59.780
Queen, can we talk?

16:01.460 --> 16:02.480
Of course!

16:02.480 --> 16:04.730
Wow, you never summon me!

16:04.730 --> 16:05.600
Wow, that was fast.

16:05.600 --> 16:06.540
What is it?

16:06.540 --> 16:07.980
A confession of love?

16:10.340 --> 16:11.480
You see...

16:11.810 --> 16:12.770
Yes?

16:13.790 --> 16:14.990
I can't believe it...

16:15.240 --> 16:18.900
Yeah, I figured you should know.

16:19.430 --> 16:24.830
I believe that humans and fairies 
must not be allowed to fight.

16:24.830 --> 16:26.170
I agree.

16:26.170 --> 16:28.250
Make sure you keep an eye out for trouble.

16:28.250 --> 16:31.540
For now, you have my thanks for 
stopping it before it started.

16:31.540 --> 16:34.040
I'll see what I can learn.

16:34.040 --> 16:35.000
Thanks.

16:35.560 --> 16:38.050
Anyway, it's time for me to sleep, 
so I'll see you later...

16:40.030 --> 16:42.390
You're saying you want to 
sleep next to me, right?

16:42.390 --> 16:43.420
I am not.

16:43.420 --> 16:45.060
Aw, you're so shy!

16:45.060 --> 16:46.470
Leave already!

16:47.800 --> 16:50.970
Okay, I will, but when can I see you next?

16:50.970 --> 16:52.260
Eventually!

16:52.260 --> 16:54.480
If you don't promise me, I won't leave.

16:54.480 --> 16:57.560
I want to give you my thanks 
for what you did today, too!

16:57.560 --> 17:01.340
Your thanks? Are you saying 
that as queen of the fairies?

17:01.340 --> 17:02.830
Of course!

17:02.830 --> 17:06.580
Thanks to you, we were able to 
avoid unnecessary bloodshed.

17:07.940 --> 17:10.230
Then I promise we can meet again.

17:10.230 --> 17:12.300
But no trying to give me a reward.

17:13.800 --> 17:15.000
Fine.

17:15.590 --> 17:18.120
<i>Do you understand, Queen?</i>

17:18.120 --> 17:20.750
<i>The way you're getting too involved with me</i>

17:20.750 --> 17:24.280
<i>is basically the same as what the 
fort commander's daughter was doing.</i>

17:26.600 --> 17:28.690
We'll miss having you here.

17:28.690 --> 17:30.950
I need to get going, though.

17:30.950 --> 17:33.300
I'm running low on enhanced oil.

17:33.300 --> 17:35.370
And I want to do some 
repairs on my bow, too.

17:38.500 --> 17:39.910
Oh, Zetan.

17:39.910 --> 17:41.270
How'd it go after that?

17:45.620 --> 17:46.850
I guess I know the answer to that!

17:47.750 --> 17:49.880
She says she wants me to move in with her.

17:52.070 --> 17:53.780
Oh, my!

17:53.780 --> 17:56.970
To the Fenrir mansion near the castle.

17:56.970 --> 18:01.300
Karen has preparations to make, 
she said, so she already left.

18:01.300 --> 18:03.710
We need to get going, too.

18:03.710 --> 18:05.610
That's great!

18:05.610 --> 18:08.140
You're heading back to a human town, right?

18:08.450 --> 18:11.670
I'm sad I won't get to give 
you a ride on my back.

18:12.790 --> 18:14.410
Don't worry about it, partner.

18:16.810 --> 18:19.270
I had a lot of fun being your partner.

18:19.270 --> 18:20.730
Let's do it again sometime.

18:24.400 --> 18:24.910
Bye!

18:24.910 --> 18:26.820
I promise we'll be happy together!

18:28.570 --> 18:32.410
You've got a long journey 
home, though, Earth.

18:32.410 --> 18:35.550
Oh, I've got something up my sleeve!

18:35.550 --> 18:38.340
Pikasha! Can you come here?

18:39.290 --> 18:42.390
That bird won't even let the royal 
family ride on them sometimes.

18:42.390 --> 18:44.770
It won't just show up here.

18:44.770 --> 18:46.140
I know.

18:46.140 --> 18:48.360
I was just joking and hoping it would work.

18:48.360 --> 18:51.040
It would be great if it did...

18:51.480 --> 18:52.640
Uh?

18:53.070 --> 18:54.280
It did work.

18:54.280 --> 18:55.820
It sure did.

19:02.540 --> 19:05.160
Okay, let me down here!

19:05.860 --> 19:10.400
If I ride you into town, 
it'll make a huge fuss!

19:11.780 --> 19:13.790
Don't get so disappointed, please...

19:21.830 --> 19:22.910
Here you go!

19:22.910 --> 19:24.610
Some cooking to thank you!

19:24.610 --> 19:26.250
Eat up!

19:36.610 --> 19:39.240
All filled up? There, there.

19:41.590 --> 19:42.830
You're sure?

19:42.950 --> 19:46.660
<b>Legendary Accessory</b>

19:42.950 --> 19:46.660
<b>Pikasha Heartfeather
 A shining feather given to those who have won the trust of a Pikasha.
 The wearer will feel less tired when wearing it.
 Wind Blessing: Stats are Increased. MP Usage reduced 15%.
 Ranged weapon and magic dodge chance 10% up. Movement speed 10% up.</b>

19:46.670 --> 19:49.980
That's an incredibly powerful effect.

19:49.980 --> 19:51.280
Thanks, Pikasha!

19:56.570 --> 19:58.010
See you around!

20:02.240 --> 20:03.760
Hey, Earth.

20:03.760 --> 20:04.960
It's been a while.

20:04.960 --> 20:06.720
I'm back.

20:06.720 --> 20:09.200
I was visiting the Fairy Kingdom,

20:09.200 --> 20:11.400
but I realized I need some new equipment.

20:11.400 --> 20:13.410
You can use the place all you like.

20:13.410 --> 20:15.570
By the way, do you have enough materials?

20:15.570 --> 20:19.720
I went to all the hunting spots, 
but they were all drained dry.

20:19.720 --> 20:21.480
I'll work things out somehow.

20:25.410 --> 20:28.450
<b>Light Metal-Coated X-Type Compound Hunting Bow
 Metal coating has been added to strengthen the bow, making it more durable and stronger at the price of becoming heavier.
 Effect: Atk+55 Score: 6</b>

20:28.440 --> 20:31.760
It's a little heavier now, 
but I think it's still okay.

20:31.760 --> 20:35.290
Its old attack power was 
46, so it's gone up by 9.

20:35.290 --> 20:39.180
This one's going to be a lot 
harder to keep repaired, though.

20:41.290 --> 20:44.970
Time to try out my new bow.

20:45.590 --> 20:47.450
A breaking announcement?

20:47.450 --> 20:50.610
"A Challenge From the Departed" 
has been fully cleared?

20:54.290 --> 20:59.960
Thank you for freeing the souls of 
those who were trapped and suffering.

20:59.960 --> 21:03.950
I am the guardian of the labyrinth.

21:05.170 --> 21:09.290
You have all purified the wicked spirit 
energy that resided within the labyrinth,

21:09.290 --> 21:12.670
and now I can finally return to heaven.

21:12.670 --> 21:16.510
I see, so this was the backstory.

21:16.510 --> 21:21.110
I'd like to reword those who 
contributed most to our freedom,

21:21.110 --> 21:23.830
but unfortunately I only 
have so many items to give.

21:25.290 --> 21:31.140
A PvP tournament that only those who 
defeated a secret boss can participate in.

21:32.140 --> 21:36.100
All the items you get from 
winning look really strong.

21:36.100 --> 21:37.980
Will you participate?

21:39.000 --> 21:39.920
No!

21:41.980 --> 21:47.070
Those rewards look great, but I don't 
want to fight in public anymore.

21:51.780 --> 21:53.870
I've never heard a cry like that before.

21:55.210 --> 21:58.290
<i>I don't want to get involved 
in any more trouble,</i>

21:58.290 --> 22:01.020
<i>but it'd bother me if I didn't look into it.</i>

22:05.970 --> 22:07.030
A dragon?!

22:07.510 --> 22:09.970
<b>To Be Continued</b>
